      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "p9-1-1",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "庁舎の中、もう売る場所がありません",
          "en": "There's nowhere left to sell inside City Hall."
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-1-2",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "なら外だ!! 歩道も広場も、ホールの座席も!!",
          "en": "Then we go outside!! Sidewalks, plazas, the hall's seats!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-1-3",
          "panel": 1,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "実績が増える……止める理由がない……!",
          "en": "More results... no reason to stop him...!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-2-1",
          "panel": 2,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "小僧、契約一本ごとに歩合をやる!!",
          "en": "Kid, you get a commission on every contract!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-3-1",
          "panel": 3,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "それ、先に言ってくださいよ!!",
          "en": "You should've said that first!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-4-1",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "本社は隣町だが、名前が出るなら!!",
          "en": "Our HQ's in the next town, but if my name's up there!!"
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-4-2",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "本社がないのに「前」でいいんですか",
          "en": "“Front” of what? Your office isn't here.",
          "note": "Japanese bus stops are often named “(landmark)-mae” — “in front of (landmark)” — after whatever stands beside them."
        },
        {
          "id": "p9-4-3",
          "panel": 4,
          "type": "speech",
          "ja": "愛称だから、いいんだよ!!",
          "en": "It's a nickname, so it's fine!!"
        }
      ]
    },
